# Wave W17-Z (Route 217): white turf — long-road snow ground, bench-pale, unbroken value: a smooth bright bench snow with the sparsest soft flecks, the long white road’s own field running from the bridge to the frozen lake (design: Rimefall’s long white road, the bench under the climb face). Route 217’s own snow ground — split from its twin Route 216’s pack turf by texture entire (smooth bench snow vs scoured pack) and from Lake Insight’s calm turf ahead by temperature: bench blue-white here, lake-calm green-white there. Pale, cold, unbroken — the winter form of the ground law.
